"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-8dc464efb5e0d01b3e8f","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-8e6e9116092025fbf916","layer":"original","quote":"瓒知术有异志，不欲遣兵，止虞；虞不可。瓒惧术闻而怨之，亦遣其从弟越，将千骑诣术以自结〖5〗；而阴教术执和〖6〗，夺其兵。由是虞、瓒益有隙。和逃术来北，复为绍所留","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":49,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":80},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-a1108d7c96f10b6ca326","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-737c16bd3c0806b0d0a1","layer":"original","quote":"和道经袁术，为说天子意。术利虞为援，留和不遣；许兵至俱西〖4〗，令和为书与虞。虞得和书，乃遣数千骑诣和","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":48,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":41,"end":92},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-f39d2c112d9d2f4dfc8f","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-55f3f26d3d70db34ceba","layer":"original","quote":"袁绍又遣麹义及虞子和，将兵与辅合击瓒","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":72,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":113,"end":131}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
